<title>USA: Fairfield Communities declares stock split.</title>
<headline>Fairfield Communities declares stock split.</headline>
<dateline>LITTLE ROCK, Ark. 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fairfield Communities Inc said Wednesday its declared a 3-for-2 stock split in the form of a 50 percent stock dividend.</p>
<p>The new shares will be distributed on July 15, 1997 to stockholders of record at the close of business on July 1, 1997, with holders receiving cash in lieu of fractional shares, The company said.</p>
<p>The Company also said it appointed Gerald Johnston to its board of directors, increasing the size of the board to eight directors.</p>
